sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Commenter
    participant API as API
    participant Q as Queue, existing on-comment-added consumer
    participant W as Worker
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant S as Socket service

    C->>API: POST /api/comment/add
    API->>DB: save comment
    API->>Q: 1 message
    API-->>C: 200 OK
    Q->>W: on-comment-added
    W->>DB: load and populate every member
    W->>S: emit per member, sequential and awaited (this fix)
    Note over W,S: bounded by the existing member cap, unchanged
